 "title": "Talent Means Nothing If Pressure Makes You Crumble",
 "topic": "mindset",
 "summary": "This post features a scene from the movie Devil's Advocate where a character explains that talent alone is not enough; the ability to handle pressure determines success. The creator claims that while talented people often fold under pressure, those who stay calm and deliver on deadlines stand out.",
 "key_points": [
  "The creator claims the world is full of talented people who fold under pressure.",
  "When a deadline, a crowd, or a big moment arrives, some people panic and their knowledge disappears.",
  "Others get sharper when it gets heavy and deliver when it matters most.",
  "The ability to handle pressure is a skill that cannot be seen on a résumé.",
  "The creator claims this skill can be trained by putting yourself in uncomfortable spots and pushing through.",
  "Anyone can perform when nothing is on the line, but legends perform when everything is.",
  "In the video transcript, the speaker notes: 'Some people, you squeeze them, they focus. Others fold.'",
  "The speaker asks: 'Can you summon your talent at will? Can you deliver on a deadline? Can you sleep at night?'"
 ],
 "content": "The world is full of talented people who fold the second there’s any pressure. 🧠🔥\n⠀\nThey’re smart, skilled and full of potential. But put a deadline in front of them, a crowd watching or a big moment on the line, and everything they know disappears.\n⠀\nThen there are the ones who get sharper when it gets heavy. They stay calm when everyone else panics and deliver when it matters most. That’s the skill nobody can see on a résumé, and it decides almost everything.\n⠀\nThe good news is it can be trained. Every time you put yourself in an uncomfortable spot and push through, you get a little harder to break.\n⠀\nAnyone can perform when nothing’s on the line, but legends perform when everything is.\n⠀\nFollow @Wealth to learn valuable advice every time you open Instagram. ⭐\n\nMedia: Devil’s Advocate \n⠀\n#Wealth #Mindset #Pressure #Discipline #LifeLessons\n\nTranscript:\nI know you got talent. I knew that before you got here. It's just the other thing I wonder about. What thing is that? Pressure. Changes everything, pressure. Some people, you squeeze them, they focus. Others fold. Can you summon your talent at will? Can you deliver on a deadline? Can you sleep at night? When do we talk about money? Money? Yeah! That's the easy part.\n\nText on screen:\nAl Pacino - Talent Means Nothing If Pressure Makes You Crumble\nI know you got talent.\nI knew that before you got here.\nIt's just the other thing\nI wonder about.\nWhat thing is that?\nPressure.\nChanges everything.\nPressure.\nSome people, you squeeze them,\nthey focus.\nOthers fold.\nCan you summon\nyour talent at will?\nCan you deliver on a deadline?\nCan you sleep at night?\nWhen do we talk about money?\nMoney?\nYeah!\nThat's the easy part.",
